{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 52, :comments ["<b>And you shall dispossess.</b> And you shall drive out." "<b>Your figured stones.</b> As the Targum renders — \"בֵּית סִגְדַתְהוֹן\" — so called because they would pave the ground with a floor of marble stones in order to prostrate upon them with outstretched hands and feet, as it says ״וְאֶבֶן מַשְׂכִּית לֹא תִּתְּנוּ בְּאַרְצְכֶם לְהִשְׁתַּחֲוֹת עָלֶיהָ״ (Leviticus 26)." "<b>And your molten images.</b> As the Targum renders — \"מַתְּכַתְהוֹן\"."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:41.565588207Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}